        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Fantastic Mr. Fox, Khan Kluay\n- People: Roald Dahl, Jason Schwartzman, Wes Anderson, King Naresuan\n- Companies: Kantana Group\n- Topics: Animation films, film collaborations\n\nFacts:\n- Fantastic Mr. Fox is a 2009 American stop-motion animated comedy film based on Roald Dahl's children's novel of the same name.\n- Khan Kluay is a 2006 Thai 3D computer-animated action adventure comedy family film set during Ayutthaya-era Siam about a Thai elephant who becomes the war elephant for King Naresuan.\n- Kantana Group is known for animation work that includes the 2006 feature film Khan Kluay.\n- Jason Schwartzman is known for frequent collaborations with Wes Anderson, including Rushmore (1998), The Darjeeling Limited (2007), Fantastic Mr. Fox (2009), Moonrise Kingdom (2012), and The Grand Budapest Hotel (2014).",
